/* Middle C: the course and the song library, in English. This is the source for every
   translation. Keys are the English text in Sources/PianoTutorCore (CourseContent.swift and
   SongLibrary.swift); a test checks that this file matches them. See docs/localization.md. */

"Meet the Keys" = "认识琴键";
"Find your way around the keyboard and play your first notes." = "熟悉键盘，弹出你的第一个音。";
"Finding Middle C" = "找到中央C";
"Use the black keys as landmarks." = "用黑键当路标。";
"Black keys come in twos and threes" = "黑键两个一组、三个一组";
"Look at your keyboard. The black keys are arranged in groups of two and groups of three, repeating all the way up." = "看看你的键盘：黑键分成两个一组和三个一组，从左到右不断重复。";
"These groups are your landmarks. Once you can spot them, you can find any note without counting from the end." = "这些组就是你的路标。只要能认出它们，不用从头数也能找到任何一个音。";
"C lives to the left of the two black keys" = "C在两个黑键的左边";
"Find any group of two black keys. The white key just to the left of the group is always C." = "随便找一组两个的黑键，紧挨在它左边的白键永远是C。";
"Your keyboard has six of them. Each one starts a new set of the same seven note names: C, D, E, F, G, A, B." = "你的键盘上有六个C。每个C都开始新的一组，组里是同样的七个音名：C、D、E、F、G、A、B（唱出来就是do、re、mi、fa、sol、la、si）。";
"Find three different Cs" = "找到三个不同的C";
"Play any C on your keyboard, then two more in other places." = "在键盘上弹任意一个C，再到别的位置弹两个C。";
"Middle C" = "中央C";
"Middle C is the C closest to the centre of the keyboard. On a 61-key keyboard such as the Casio CT-S300, it is the third C from the left." = "中央C是最靠近键盘中间的那个C。在Casio CT-S300这样的61键键盘上，它是从左数第三个C。";
"Almost everything you play at first starts here, so it is worth knowing where it is without looking for long." = "刚开始你弹的几乎所有曲子都从这里开始，所以最好能一眼就找到它。";
"Play Middle C" = "弹中央C";
"It is lit up on the keyboard below." = "它在下面的键盘上亮着。";
"Now from memory" = "现在凭记忆弹";
"Middle C, the C below it, the C above it, then Middle C again." = "中央C、它下面的C、它上面的C，再回到中央C。";
"Three Notes: C, D, E" = "三个音：C、D、E";
"Thumb on Middle C, and your first tune." = "大拇指放在中央C上，弹你的第一首曲子。";
"Fingers have numbers" = "手指有编号";
"Pianists number their fingers from 1 to 5. In both hands the thumb is 1 and the little finger is 5." = "弹钢琴的人给手指编号1到5。两只手都一样：大拇指是1，小指是5。";
"Rest your right thumb on Middle C and let fingers 2 and 3 sit on the next two white keys, D and E. Keep your fingers gently curved, as if you were holding a small ball." = "把右手大拇指放在中央C上，2指和3指放在旁边的两个白键D和E上。手指自然弯曲，就像握着一个小球。";
"Play C, D, E" = "弹C、D、E";
"One finger per key: 1, 2, 3." = "一个手指弹一个键：1、2、3。";
"Stepping up and down" = "上行和下行";
"The music waits for you. Take your time and find each key." = "乐谱会等你。慢慢来，找准每个键。";
"Mix them up" = "打乱顺序";
"Watch the note heads move up and down, and follow them with your fingers." = "看着符头上上下下，用手指跟着弹。";
"Hot Cross Buns" = "热十字面包";
"A traditional tune that needs only these three notes." = "一首只用这三个音的传统曲调。";
"Five-Finger Position" = "五指位置";
"One finger for each key from C to G." = "从C到G，每个键一个手指。";
"One finger for each key" = "每个键一个手指";
"Add F and G. Now every finger has a key of its own: 1 on C, 2 on D, 3 on E, 4 on F and 5 on G." = "加上F和G。现在每个手指都有自己的键：1指放C，2指放D，3指放E，4指放F，5指放G。";
"This is called the C position. Your hand stays in one place and only your fingers move, so you never need to look down to find the next note." = "这叫C位置。手保持在原地不动，只有手指在动，所以你不用低头找下一个音。";
"Find F and G" = "找到F和G";
"Follow the lit keys." = "跟着亮起的键弹。";
"Climb and come back" = "爬上去再下来";
"Skipping keys" = "跳过一个键";
"Sometimes the tune jumps over a key. The finger numbers show you which finger to use." = "有时旋律会跳过一个键。指法数字会告诉你该用哪个手指。";
"Lightly Row" = "小蜜蜂";
"A German folk tune that uses all five notes." = "一首用到全部五个音的德国民歌。";
"Feel the Beat" = "感受节拍";
"Play in time: quarter, half and whole notes, and rests." = "跟着节拍弹：四分音符、二分音符、全音符和休止符。";
"Quarter and Half Notes" = "四分音符和二分音符";
"Keep a steady beat with the metronome." = "跟着节拍器保持稳定的拍子。";
"Music has a steady beat" = "音乐有稳定的节拍";
"Underneath every piece runs a steady pulse, like a ticking clock. From now on some exercises are played in time: you will hear a click on every beat, and one measure of clicks to count you in." = "每首曲子底下都有一个稳定的脉搏，就像嘀嗒走的时钟。从现在起，有些练习要跟着节拍弹：每一拍都会有一声“嗒”，开始前还会先响一小节帮你数拍。";
"A quarter note has a filled-in head and a stem. It lasts one beat. A half note has a hollow head and a stem. It lasts two beats: play it, then keep the key down through the next click." = "四分音符是实心符头加一根符干，时值一拍。二分音符是空心符头加一根符干，时值两拍：弹下去之后，按住琴键，直到下一声“嗒”过去。";
"One note, steady beat" = "一个音，稳定的拍子";
"Listen to the count-in, then play along with the clicks." = "先听预备拍，然后跟着节拍声弹。";
"Steps in time" = "跟着拍子走";
"Same rhythm idea, now moving between notes." = "同样的节奏，现在要在几个音之间移动。";
"You know the notes. This time, keep it with the beat." = "音你已经会了。这次要跟上拍子。";
"Whole Notes and Rests" = "全音符和休止符";
"Long notes, and the sound of silence." = "长音，还有安静的声音。";
"Whole notes last four beats" = "全音符有四拍";
"A whole note is a hollow head with no stem. Play it on the first beat and hold the key down for all four." = "全音符是空心符头，没有符干。在第一拍弹下去，然后按住琴键，持续整整四拍。";
"Silence is written down too. A rest tells you to wait: the zigzag is a quarter rest (one beat), the small block sitting on a line is a half rest (two beats), and a block hanging under a line means a whole measure of silence." = "安静也会写在谱上。休止符告诉你要等待：弯弯曲曲的是四分休止符（一拍），坐在线上的小方块是二分休止符（两拍），挂在线下的小方块表示整整一小节都不弹。";
"Hold it" = "按住";
"Count to four on the whole notes." = "弹全音符时数到四。";
"Leave a gap" = "留出空隙";
"Lift your finger on the rests and let the click pass." = "遇到休止符就抬起手指，让那一声“嗒”过去。";
"Mary Had a Little Lamb" = "玛丽有只小羊羔";
"Learn the notes first. The music waits for you. Take your time and find each key." = "先学会音符。乐谱会等你。慢慢来，找准每个键。";
"Now in time. Watch out for the long notes." = "现在跟着节拍弹。注意长音。";
"Song: Lightly Row" = "歌曲：小蜜蜂";
"A complete tune in C position." = "一首完全在C位置上的曲子。";
"Putting it together" = "连起来弹";
"You already know the first half of this German folk tune. The second half repeats one note several times before returning to the opening." = "这首德国民歌的前半部分你已经会了。后半部分会把一个音重复好几次，然后回到开头的旋律。";
"Learn the notes in practice mode first, then play it in time." = "先用练习模式学会音符，再跟着节拍弹。";
"Song: Ode to Joy" = "歌曲：欢乐颂";
"Beethoven's famous theme." = "贝多芬的著名主题。";
"A melody everybody knows" = "人人都熟悉的旋律";
"Beethoven built the grand finale of his Ninth Symphony on a tune that moves almost entirely by step, using just the five notes under your fingers." = "贝多芬第九交响曲宏伟的终乐章，就建立在这段旋律上。它几乎全是级进，只用到你手指下的这五个音。";
"This version keeps the rhythm simple. You will meet the original rhythm later in the course." = "这个版本的节奏比较简单。后面的课程里你会学到原版的节奏。";
"Ode to Joy" = "欢乐颂";
"Read the Staff" = "读五线谱";
"Learn to read notes without the letter names." = "学会不看音名也能读谱。";
"Lines and Spaces" = "线和间";
"Where your five notes live on the staff." = "你的五个音在五线谱上的位置。";
"The staff" = "五线谱";
"Notes are written on a set of five lines called a staff. The higher a note sits on the staff, the further to the right it is on the keyboard." = "音符写在五条平行线上，这叫五线谱。音符在谱上的位置越高，在键盘上就越靠右。";
"The curly sign at the start is the treble clef, which is used for the right hand. A note sits either on a line, with the line running through its head, or in the space between two lines." = "开头那个弯弯的符号是高音谱号，用于右手。音符要么在线上（线从符头中间穿过），要么在两条线之间的间里。";
"Your five notes" = "你的五个音";
"Middle C hangs below the staff on a short line of its own. D sits just under the bottom line. E is on the bottom line, F is in the first space and G is on the second line." = "中央C挂在五线谱下方，有一条属于自己的短线。D紧贴在第一线下面。E在第一线上，F在第一间，G在第二线上。";
"So far the letter names have been printed inside the notes. In this lesson they are gradually taken away." = "到目前为止，音名一直印在音符里。这一课会把它们一步步拿掉。";
"Names and key hints" = "音名和按键提示";
"Notice where each note sits on the staff as you play it." = "边弹边留意每个音在谱上的位置。";
"Names only" = "只有音名";
"The keyboard no longer lights up. Use the letters." = "键盘不再亮起，请看字母。";
"Key hints only" = "只有按键提示";
"The letters are gone. Check the keyboard only if you get stuck." = "字母没有了。卡住时再看键盘。";
"On your own" = "靠你自己";
"No names and no hints: you are reading music." = "没有音名，也没有提示：你在读谱了！";
"Steps and Skips" = "级进和跳进";
"Read by shape instead of naming every note." = "看旋律的形状来读谱，不用叫出每个音名。";
"Read the distance, not every name" = "看距离，不用认每个音名";
"When a note moves from a line to the very next space, or from a space to the next line, play the neighbouring key. That is a step." = "当音符从线上移到紧挨着的间里，或从间里移到下一条线上，就弹相邻的键。这叫级进。";
"When it jumps from one line to the next line, or from a space to the next space, miss out a key. That is a skip. Fluent readers follow these shapes instead of naming each note." = "当它从一条线跳到下一条线，或从一个间跳到下一个间，就隔过一个键。这叫跳进。读谱熟练的人看的是这些形状，而不是一个个叫出音名。";
"Steps" = "级进";
"Every note here moves to its neighbour, or repeats." = "这里每个音都移到相邻的音，或者重复。";
"Skips" = "跳进";
"Line to line, space to space." = "线到线，间到间。";
"Steps and skips together" = "级进和跳进一起练";
"Song: Au Clair de la Lune" = "歌曲：在月光下";
"Read a French folk tune." = "读一首法国民歌。";
"Read it yourself" = "自己读谱";
"This French folk tune is more than two hundred years old. It moves mostly by step, with one skip." = "这首法国民歌已经有两百多年的历史了。它大多是级进，只有一处跳进。";
"There are no letter names this time. Find the first note, then follow the shape of the line." = "这次没有音名。先找到第一个音，然后跟着旋律线的形状弹。";
"Au Clair de la Lune" = "在月光下";
"Song: Go Tell Aunt Rhody" = "歌曲：去告诉罗迪阿姨";
"Half notes and quarter notes in a folk song." = "一首有二分音符和四分音符的民歌。";
"Look ahead" = "往前看";
"This folk song mixes half notes and quarter notes. While you hold a long note, use the time to look at what comes next." = "这首民歌里二分音符和四分音符交替出现。按住长音的时候，趁机看看后面是什么。";
"Go Tell Aunt Rhody" = "去告诉罗迪阿姨";
"The Left Hand" = "左手";
"A second hand and a second clef." = "第二只手，第二个谱号。";
"Left-Hand Position" = "左手位置";
"Little finger on the C below Middle C." = "小指放在中央C下面的C上。";
"Meet your left hand" = "认识你的左手";
"Fingers are numbered the same way in the left hand, with the thumb as 1. Because the left hand mirrors the right, your little finger now plays the lowest note." = "左手的手指编号也一样，大拇指是1。因为左手和右手是镜像的，所以现在由小指弹最低的音。";
"Find the C below Middle C. Put finger 5 on it and let the other fingers rest on D, E, F and G. Your left thumb ends up on G." = "找到中央C下面的C，把5指放在上面，其他手指放在D、E、F、G上。左手大拇指正好落在G上。";
"Find your left-hand notes" = "找到左手的音";
"Follow the lit keys with your left hand." = "用左手跟着亮起的键弹。";
"Left hand climbs" = "左手往上爬";
"Left hand skips" = "左手跳进";
"Fingers 5, 3 and 1 play C, E and G." = "用5指、3指、1指弹C、E、G。";
"The Bass Clef" = "低音谱号";
"Reading low notes." = "读低音。";
"A staff for low notes" = "低音的谱表";
"Left-hand music is written in the bass clef. Its two dots sit either side of the line for F, which is why it is also called the F clef." = "左手的谱用低音谱号来写。它的两个点分别在F那条线的上下两侧，所以它也叫F谱号。";
"In the bass clef your five notes are: C in the second space, D on the middle line, E in the third space, F on the fourth line and G in the top space." = "在低音谱号里，你的五个音是：C在第二间，D在第三线（中间那条线），E在第三间，F在第四线，G在第四间（最上面的间）。";
"Names, no key hints" = "有音名，无按键提示";
"Read the letters and notice where each note sits." = "读字母，同时留意每个音的位置。";
"Key hints, no names" = "有按键提示，无音名";
"Now read the positions." = "现在读位置。";
"Low and steady" = "低沉而稳定";
"Passing the Tune" = "旋律传递";
"Both staves at once, one hand at a time." = "同时看两行谱，一次一只手。";
"Two staves, one piece" = "两行谱，一首曲子";
"Piano music joins two staves together: the treble staff on top for the right hand and the bass staff underneath for the left. Both are read from left to right at the same time." = "钢琴谱把两行谱表连在一起：上面是高音谱表，给右手；下面是低音谱表，给左手。两行谱同时从左往右读。";
"In this lesson the tune passes from hand to hand, so only one hand plays at a time. Keep both hands resting in position, ready for their turn." = "这一课里旋律在两只手之间传递，所以每次只有一只手在弹。两只手都放在位置上，准备轮到自己。";
"Question and answer" = "一问一答";
"The last note is your first with both hands together." = "最后一个音是你第一次双手一起弹。";
"Echo" = "回声";
"The left hand copies the right." = "左手模仿右手。";
"Hands Together" = "双手合奏";
"Play a tune in one hand over long notes in the other." = "一只手弹旋律，另一只手弹长音。";
"Hold and Play" = "按住再弹";
"One long note under a moving tune." = "流动的旋律下面一个长音。";
"Start with one held note" = "从一个按住的音开始";
"Playing with both hands is a new skill for your brain, so start small: the left hand holds one long note while the right hand plays over the top." = "双手一起弹对大脑来说是一项新技能，所以从简单的开始：左手按住一个长音，右手在上面弹旋律。";
"Practise each hand alone, then join them. In practice mode the music waits until both hands are on the right keys." = "先分手练，再合起来。在练习模式里，乐谱会等到两只手都按对键才继续。";
"Right hand alone" = "右手单独练";
"Left hand alone" = "左手单独练";
"Four slow notes. Count four beats for each." = "四个慢音，每个数四拍。";
"Hands together" = "双手一起";
"Where notes line up vertically, press them at the same moment." = "上下对齐的音，要同时按下去。";
"Hands together, in time" = "双手一起，跟着节拍";
"Song: Mary Had a Little Lamb" = "歌曲：玛丽有只小羊羔";
"A tune you know, now with both hands." = "熟悉的曲子，现在用双手弹。";
"Add a bass line" = "加上低音声部";
"You have played this tune with your right hand. Now the left hand adds one long note in every measure, either C or G." = "这首曲子你已经用右手弹过了。现在左手在每小节加一个长音，C或G。";
"Beethoven with both hands." = "用双手弹贝多芬。";
"The left hand changes more often" = "左手换得更勤";
"The bass line again uses only C and G, but watch the final measure: the left hand plays two half notes there instead of one whole note." = "低音声部还是只用C和G，但要注意最后一小节：左手在那里弹两个二分音符，而不是一个全音符。";
"Quicker Notes" = "更快的音符";
"Eighth notes and dotted rhythms." = "八分音符和附点节奏。";
"Eighth Notes" = "八分音符";
"Two notes to every beat." = "每拍两个音。";
"Two notes to a beat" = "一拍两个音";
"Eighth notes move twice as fast as quarter notes, so two of them fit into one beat. They are usually joined in pairs by a thick beam." = "八分音符比四分音符快一倍，所以一拍里能放两个。它们通常两个一组，用一根粗粗的符杠连在一起。";
"Count them \"one-and, two-and\". Play the first of each pair on the click and the second exactly halfway to the next click." = "数成“一哒、二哒”。每组第一个音在“嗒”声上弹，第二个音正好在到下一声“嗒”的一半时弹。";
"Running up and down" = "上下跑动";
"Hot Cross Buns, as written" = "原版《热十字面包》";
"The real rhythm has a measure of eighth notes." = "原版的节奏里有一小节八分音符。";
"Quick and slow" = "快和慢";
"Keep the quarter notes just as steady as before." = "四分音符要和之前一样稳。";
"Dotted Quarter Notes" = "附点四分音符";
"Long-short rhythms." = "长短节奏。";
"A dot makes a note longer" = "附点让音符变长";
"A dot after a note adds half of its length again. A dotted quarter note lasts one and a half beats, and it is nearly always followed by a single eighth note that completes the second beat." = "音符后面的附点，会再加上它本身一半的时值。附点四分音符是一拍半，后面几乎总是跟着一个八分音符，把第二拍补完整。";
"Count \"one, (two), and\": hold the dotted note through the second click, then slip the short note in just after it." = "数“一、（二）、哒”：按住附点音符，让第二声“嗒”过去，然后紧接着把短音弹进去。";
"Long, short, long" = "长、短、长";
"Largo" = "广板";
"The slow theme from Dvořák's \"New World\" Symphony is built on this rhythm." = "德沃夏克《自新大陆》交响曲里那段舒缓的主题，就是用这个节奏写的。";
"Slow and calm." = "慢慢地，平静地。";
"Ode to Joy, as Beethoven wrote it" = "贝多芬原版的《欢乐颂》";
"The fourth and last measures now have the dotted rhythm." = "第四小节和最后一小节现在有了附点节奏。";
"Song: Jingle Bells" = "歌曲：铃儿响叮当";
"Both hands, with everything so far." = "双手弹，用上学过的一切。";
"Everything so far" = "学过的全用上";
"The chorus of this 1857 song stays inside the C position and uses quarter notes, half notes, whole notes, eighth notes and a dotted rhythm." = "这首1857年歌曲的副歌一直在C位置内，用到了四分音符、二分音符、全音符、八分音符和附点节奏。";
"The left hand has one long note per measure: C, F or G." = "左手每小节一个长音：C、F或G。";
"Right hand" = "右手";
"Jingle Bells" = "铃儿响叮当";
"Beyond Five Notes" = "超越五个音";
"Stretch, move, and use the black keys." = "伸展、移动，用上黑键。";
"Reaching Up to A" = "伸到A";
"One more note than you have fingers." = "音比手指多一个。";
"Six notes, five fingers" = "六个音，五个手指";
"Many tunes need one more note than your hand covers. A is the white key just above G." = "很多曲子需要比手能覆盖的多一个音。A就是G右边紧挨着的白键。";
"To reach it, let your hand open a little so that finger 5 can stretch up to A while finger 4 takes G. Then let the hand close back into the C position." = "为了够到它，把手稍微张开一点，让5指伸到A，4指来弹G。然后再把手收回到C位置。";
"Find A" = "找到A";
"G, up to A, and back." = "G，上到A，再回来。";
"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star" = "小星星";
"Follow the finger numbers in the first two measures." = "前两小节跟着指法数字弹。";
"Long, Long Ago" = "很久以前";
"One reach up to A in the third measure." = "第三小节有一次伸到A。";
"Sharps and Flats" = "升号和降号";
"The black keys get names." = "黑键也有名字。";
"Black keys are named after their neighbours" = "黑键以旁边的白键命名";
"A sharp (♯) means the very next key to the right. A flat (♭) means the very next key to the left. So the black key just above F is F sharp, and the black key just below B is B flat." = "升号（♯）表示右边紧挨着的那个键，降号（♭）表示左边紧挨着的那个键。所以F右边的黑键是升F（F♯），B左边的黑键是降B（B♭）。";
"Every black key therefore has two names: F sharp is also G flat. On the staff the sign is written just before the note, and it stays in force until the end of the measure." = "所以每个黑键都有两个名字：F♯也是G♭。在谱上，这个记号写在音符的正前方，一直到这一小节结束都有效。";
"Find the black keys" = "找到黑键";
"Each one is named from the white key beside it." = "每个黑键都按旁边的白键来命名。";
"D position" = "D位置";
"Move your thumb to D. Finger 3 now plays F sharp." = "把大拇指移到D，现在3指弹F♯。";
"F position" = "F位置";
"Thumb on F. Finger 4 plays B flat." = "大拇指放在F上，4指弹B♭。";
"Key signatures" = "调号";
"When a piece uses the same sharps or flats all the way through, they are written once at the start of every staff instead of in front of each note. This is called a key signature." = "如果一首曲子从头到尾都用同样的升号或降号，就只在每行谱的开头写一次，而不是在每个音符前面都写。这叫调号。";
"Two sharps, written where F and C sit on the staff, mean that every F and every C in the piece is played sharp." = "两个升号分别写在F和C的位置上，表示曲子里所有的F和C都要弹升高的音。";
"Remember the key signature" = "记住调号";
"There are no sharp signs in front of the notes now, but every F is still F sharp." = "现在音符前面没有升号了，但每个F仍然是F♯。";
"G Position" = "G位置";
"Move the whole hand to a new place." = "把整只手移到新位置。";
"Positions can move" = "位置可以移动";
"Put your right thumb on the G above Middle C. Your five fingers now cover G, A, B, C and D." = "把右手大拇指放在中央C上面的G上。现在你的五个手指覆盖G、A、B、C、D。";
"The finger pattern is exactly the same as before. Only the notes are new." = "指法和之前完全一样，只是音换成新的了。";
"Find the G position" = "找到G位置";
"Five new notes" = "五个新音";
"Ode to Joy in G" = "G位置弹《欢乐颂》";
"The same tune you know, five notes higher." = "你熟悉的旋律，高了五个音。";
"Song: Frère Jacques" = "歌曲：两只老虎";
"A round that leaves the position." = "一首会离开手位的轮唱曲。";
"Leaving the position" = "离开手位";
"This French round reaches up to A in the quick notes and then dips down to the G below Middle C at the end." = "这首曲子原本是法国轮唱曲《雅克兄弟》。在快速的音符里它会伸到A，结尾再下探到中央C下面的G。";
"For the last two measures, let finger 2 take Middle C so that your thumb is free to reach down to G." = "最后两小节，用2指弹中央C，这样大拇指就能空出来，往下够到G。";
"Frère Jacques" = "两只老虎";
"Chords" = "和弦";
"Play several notes at once and accompany a tune." = "同时弹几个音，为旋律伴奏。";
"Your First Chord" = "你的第一个和弦";
"C, E and G together." = "C、E、G一起弹。";
"Three notes at once" = "三个音同时弹";
"A chord is several notes played together. The C major chord uses every other key of your five-finger position: C, E and G, played with fingers 1, 3 and 5." = "和弦就是几个音一起弹。C大三和弦用的是五指位置上隔一个取一个的键：C、E、G，用1指、3指、5指来弹。";
"Press all three keys at exactly the same moment, with a relaxed wrist. On the staff the notes of a chord are stacked on top of each other." = "手腕放松，三个键要在同一瞬间按下。在谱上，和弦的音是一个叠一个摞在一起的。";
"Build the chord" = "搭起和弦";
"First one note at a time, then all three together." = "先一个一个弹，再三个一起弹。";
"Left-hand chord" = "左手和弦";
"The same three notes with fingers 5, 3 and 1." = "同样的三个音，用5指、3指、1指弹。";
"Chords in time" = "跟着节拍弹和弦";
"Lift and replay the chord cleanly on each beat." = "每一拍都干净利落地抬起，再弹下和弦。";
"Three Chords: C, F and G" = "三个和弦：C、F、G";
"Change chords without moving far." = "换和弦，手不用移太远。";
"Three chords go a long way" = "三个和弦就够用";
"The chords of C, F and G are enough to accompany hundreds of songs. To keep the hand still, the notes of F and G are rearranged so that they sit close to the C chord." = "C、F、G这三个和弦就足以给成百上千首歌伴奏。为了让手保持不动，F和弦与G和弦的音会重新排列，让它们靠近C和弦。";
"For F, keep the little finger on C and move the upper two fingers up to F and A. For G, keep the thumb on G and move the lower two fingers down to B and D." = "弹F和弦时，小指留在C上，上面两个手指往上移到F和A。弹G和弦时，大拇指留在G上，下面两个手指往下移到B和D。";
"Changing chords" = "换和弦";
"Move only the fingers that need to move." = "只移动需要移动的手指。";
"Changing chords in time" = "跟着节拍换和弦";
"Look ahead to the next chord while you hold the current one." = "按住当前和弦的同时，提前看下一个和弦。";
"Song: Twinkle with Chords" = "歌曲：带和弦的小星星";
"Melody and accompaniment." = "旋律与伴奏。";
"Melody and accompaniment" = "旋律与伴奏";
"This is how a great deal of piano music works: the right hand plays the tune while the left hand supplies chords underneath." = "很多钢琴曲都是这样：右手弹旋律，左手在下面弹和弦。";
"Learn the left-hand chord changes first. They follow the tune closely, changing twice in most measures." = "先学会左手的和弦变换。它们紧跟着旋律，大多数小节里要换两次。";
"Left-hand chords" = "左手和弦";
